#: Sidralune/Views/SettingsView.cs
msgid "Sidralune {0} — an integrated astronomy suite for planning, observing, imaging and science."
msgstr "Sidralune {0} — terviklik astronoomiatarkvara planeerimiseks, vaatlemiseks, pildistamiseks ja teaduseks."

#: Sidralune/Views/SettingsView.cs
msgid "Algorithms: IAU 2006 precession and nutation, JPL DE440 (SPK) or Standish/ELP2000 analytic ephemerides, SGP4 (Vallado 2006),\nKrisciunas & Schaefer sky brightness, Schaefer visual thresholds, triangle-invariant star matching with RANSAC, TAN-SIP WCS,\nstacking with kappa-sigma, winsorized, linear-fit and generalized-ESD rejection, drizzle (Fruchter & Hook),\nRichardson-Lucy with total variation (Dey et al.), starlet wavelets (Starck & Murtagh), generalized hyperbolic stretch,\nmulti-point lucky imaging, spherical planetary derotation, generalised Lomb-Scargle, BLS, PDM, Kwee-van Woerden, Mandel-Agol-type transit model with ensemble MCMC."
msgstr "Algoritmid: IAU 2006 pretsessioon ja nutatsioon, JPL DE440 (SPK) või Standish/ELP2000 analüütilised efemeriidid, SGP4 (Vallado 2006),\nKrisciunase & Schaeferi taeva heledus, Schaeferi visuaalsed lävendid, kolmnurkinvariantne tähtede sobitamine RANSAC-iga, TAN-SIP WCS,\nliitmine kappa-sigma, winsoriseeritud, lineaarsobitus- ja üldistatud ESD-tagasilükkamisega, drizzle (Fruchter & Hook),\nRichardson-Lucy koguvariatsiooniga (Dey jt), starlet-lainikud (Starck & Murtagh), üldistatud hüperboolne venitus,\nmitmepunktiline lucky imaging, planeetide sfääriline derotatsioon, üldistatud Lomb-Scargle, BLS, PDM, Kwee-van Woerden, Mandel-Agol-tüüpi transiidimudel ansambli-MCMC-ga."

#: Sidralune/Views/SettingsView.cs
msgid "Data © their providers: JPL/NASA, Minor Planet Center, HYG Database (D. Nash), OpenNGC (M. Verga), Stellarium, CDS (SIMBAD/VizieR), AAVSO, CelesTrak."
msgstr "Andmed © nende pakkujad: JPL/NASA, Minor Planet Center, HYG Database (D. Nash), OpenNGC (M. Verga), Stellarium, CDS (SIMBAD/VizieR), AAVSO, CelesTrak."

